  "description_html": "<section aria-labelledby=\"courseDescription\">\n    Offered:  Spring.\n\nPrerequisite: An introductory statistics course or permission of instructor.\n\nStatistical process control is an important topic for anyone interested in applying statistics in industry. This course focuses on theory and methods of quality monitoring including process capability, control charts, acceptance sampling, quality engineering, and quality design.\n    \n</section>",
